From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: jimmy <tliang92@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 11:20:35 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] acpc: line breaks and whole-item wrapping in the status line

/statusline gains line-break and line-break-2 items that start a new
row. Rows that overflow now wrap between items instead of splitting
one across rows; an item wider than the row still wraps at words.
